    categoryLabelZh: "智能体架构",
    titleEn: "Xiaoyuan Detective / 小元查证",
    titleZh: "小元查证 (AI事实核查与实体对齐系统)",
    descEn: "Automated truth verification workbench integrating Tencent Yuanbao WSA API, GLM deduction, anti-misinformation entity cross-checking matrix, and persistent memory.",
